A simple and complete app for self-timer, continuous shooting and selfie, with grills, timer and adjustable intervals! 

Features: 
- Works on iPhone, iPad and iPod touch; 
- Timer first photo, adjustable from 0s to 120s; 
- Multiple shots, adjustable from 1 to 200; 
- Timer for multiple shots in sequence and adjustable from 2s to 120s; 
- Flash on, off, automatic; 
- Turn on the flashlight to illuminate the scene; 
- Beep sound for 5 seconds before each shot (can be disabled); 
- Auto-save in the photo gallery (can be disabled); 
- Three grids to better frame the scene (rule of thirds and the golden section); 
- Automatic recognition of faces; 
- Front and rear camera; 
- Digital Zoom; 
- Focus Automatic or manual; 
- Preview photos in high definition; 
- Share photos on social networks, or with your favorite applications, printing, copying, use as background Wallpaper! 


For information or suggestions, please use the Contact Us form in the Info menu of the application.

SLR Pro Camera was developed to help professional photographers have a better time with their own personal device unlocking all of its functions such as manual focus, iso and shutter priority.
Using the latest APIs it has been possible to unlock important features, turning the usual device camera into a new powerful one similar to a professional SLR one.

Thanks to a simple but yet useful interface it is possible to adjust all the settings on the go, being able to see the changes in real time.

The user can also set the white balance (WB) as he prefers, settings the RGB values individually.

By setting these parameters you will be able to shoot much better looking photos! 
SLR will let you shot Low light/night photos, thanks to low shutter speeds, and you will be able to improve the quality of high speed moving objects using higher shutter speeds!

Main features:
• Manual and Auto controls;
• ISO setting;
• Shutter priority setting;
• Manual/Auto Focus;
• White Balance settings including RGB values;
• Flash On/Off/Auto;
• Maximum image quality output;
• Improved Zoom;

Apple Watch or iPhone  - it’s your choice now.
Go as pro, be your own hero.


- Control your action camera on distance up to 20m (65ft);
- Save your camera power using bluetooth only;
- Automatic connection;
- Mode change;
- Shooting;
- Works without your iPhone, complete independent using just your Apple Watch;


Limitations:
- Doesn't support old models 4th generation and lower;
- Several issues connected with hardware synchronization still possible: there are multiple camera models and different firmwares for each of model.

